{
  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "\ufffda het he mid \u00fe\u00e6m palistas, mid \u00fe\u00e6m hie weallas br\u00e6con, \u00feonne hie on f\u00e6stenne fuhton, \u00fe\u00e6t hiere \u00dea wear\u00f0 hiere mid anum wierpe an ribb forod, \u00fe\u00e6t hio si\u00fe\u00fean m\u00e6gen ne h\u00e6fde hie to \u00dea hio gefylled w\u00e6s, he het hie behyldan, & \u00fea hyde to Rome bringan, & hie \u00f0\u00e6r to m\u00e6r\u00f0e \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefeaht Regulus wi\u00f0 III Pena cyningas on anum gefeohte, wi\u00f0 twegen Hasterbalas, & On \u00f0\u00e6m gefeohte w\u00e6s Cartainiensa VII M ofslagen, & VX M gefangen, & XI elpendas genumen, \u00dea, \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Cartainiense gefliemde w\u00e6ron, hie wilnedon fri\u00fees to Regule. Ac eft \u00fea hie angeatan \u00fe\u00e6t he ungemetlic gafol wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m fri\u00fee habban wolde, \u00fea cw\u00e6don hie \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea sendon hie \u00e6fter fultume \u00e6g\u00feer ge on Gallie, ge on Ispanie, ge on L\u00e6cedemonie \u00e6fter Eft, \u00fea hie ealle gesomnad w\u00e6ron, \u00fea be\u00feohtan hie ealle heora wigcr\u00e6ftas to Exantipuse. & he si\u00fe\u00fean \u00fea folc gel\u00e6dde \u00fe\u00e6r hie tog\u00e6dere gecweden h\u00e6fdon, & gesette twa folc diegellice on \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Romana XXX M ofslagen, & Regulus gefangen mid V hunde monna. \u00deiss gewear\u00fe Punicum on \u00fe\u00e6m teo\u00f0an geare hiora gewinnes & Romana. Ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s Exantipus for eft to his agnum rice, & him Romane andred, for \u00feon",
